"""Hand-written annotations merged with registry introspection by catalog_gen.py.

DESC: one-line description for every registered operator (the catalog test fails if one is missing).
DETAIL: richer metadata (parameter types/ranges/choices/meaning, lag, cost, finance uses, caveats)
for the operators most used in financial signal processing.  ``lag`` is a Python expression of the
glyph parameters (``p``) giving the approximate low-frequency group delay in samples; the authoring
layer evaluates it to estimate total pipeline lag.
"""

